CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/d/e com/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/effects/EffectObject
	COMMENT EffectObject - one live particle/effect instance (created from an EffectTemplate). Named fields, each verified from the assignment made in EffectTemplate.a(x,y,height,dir,attachedTo,...): template (the EffectTemplate), recursionDepth (short = recursion+1), visibleInFog, fadeOut, hasFadeIn, fadeInTime, atmospheric, physics, physicsGravity, priority, color, lightingColorFilter, alpha, scaleTo, scaleFrom, x, y, height, speedX, speedY, speedHeight, dirSpeed, delayedStartTimer, life, lifeMax, direction, animateFrames, animateFrameStart, animateFrameEnd, animateFrameCurrent, animateFramePingPong, animateFrameLooping, animateFrameSpeed, frameIndex, stripIndex, drawLayer, shadow. Still obfuscated (no direct assignment evidence): b (owner GameObject), C (second LightingColorFilter), c/d/f/n/o/p (flags), g/h/i/j/k/l/m (ints), aa (String), ab (Paint), ac/ad (floats), at/ax (Paint), au/av/aw, ay (effect engine), D, H, L, M, N, O, S, T, X, al, am, an, ao, aq. [field names verified from code]
